{"kind":"speech","text":"Yes—that's smaller than putting the whole array back. For review I'd replace the history Tensor with a frame ID, label and float score, taking the maximum and copying those values before the next inference. I'd still need to check whether reading the scores through this wrapper requires a temporary array. Then I'd use the last replay to render both entries after B and compare them with the references: different labels, both raw scores 2. If that passes, we've checked this two-frame history case; we haven't measured a speedup."}